<title>BANGLADESH: BANGLADESH BANK 30-DAY T-BILL YIELD DOWN AT 8.4PCT.</title>
<headline>BANGLADESH BANK 30-DAY T-BILL YIELD DOWN AT 8.4PCT.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh Bank, the central bank, sold 30-day treasury bills worth 4.413 billion taka with a corresponding yield at 8.4 percent against the previous 8.59 percent at an auction on Wednesday, the bank said.</p>
<p>The weighted average price of bills was 99.3 compared with the previous 99.29.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-869749</p>
</text>
